"{"hooks":{"path":"<SCRATCH>/Scout/.codex/hooks.json","changed":true},"mcp":{"path":"<SCRATCH>/Scout/.codex/config.toml","changed":true},"rules":{"path":"<SCRATCH>/Scout/.codex/rules/agentlayer.rules","changed":true},"entries":4,"profile":{"name":"agentlayer","workspaceRoots":["<SCRATCH>/code"],"rules":["git push"],"forbidden":["gh"],"servers":["xcode","acme-db"]},"notes":["<SCRATCH>/user-codex.toml sets default_permissions; this home's profile overrides it for sessions started here, and Codex does not combine sandbox_mode with a profile","model is \\"operator-model\\" in <SCRATCH>/Scout/.codex/config.toml; the recommended value is \\"gpt-6.2-sol\\" and yours was kept","acme-env was not mirrored into <SCRATCH>/Scout/.codex/config.toml: its .mcp.json entry uses \${VAR}, which Claude Code fills in and Codex does not"]}
